    "featured": false,
    "content": "---\nid: \"lai-haraoba\"\ntitle: \"LAI HARAOBA\"\nsummary: \"Kanglei Halaopa\"\ndate: \"2026-10-23\"\nauthor: \"Yawol Khongthang Kangleipak\"\ncategory: \"Philosophy\"\nthumbnail: \"./images/1000208220-200kb.jpg\"\nlanguage: \"en\"\nfeatured: false\n---\n\nLai haraoba haiba thouram asi karino khanglaktaba.\n\nAdungai Koupru (Koubru) Chingdon da Laiyam singna khunda leitaduna panlamba matamda Tengpalpa Taipangpalpa mapu mahakna Taipang Mee semge haina khanlakle madudagu Mee semba houre ahouba numit adubu Langmaiching kou e mee sembagi Aroiba numit aduna Thangcha kou e.\n\nKanglei Puya da asumna eri : Talang Paopu Peenapa, Eepungloinapakee Yathangna Oikhipa malamna laiyamsingna \nhalaole. Eepungloina Halaole yaifapakee mateekpu laiyamsingna penchale. Aasum Touna Loipee Cheengkee Cheengtonta Mafam, Mafam yengtuna tuuka waaka Patuna Nungngai thoina Pankhale.\n\nMatang asidage Lai haraoba haiba thouram asi lakkhibani. \n\nLai haraoba gi matangda :\n\nLai haraoba haiba asi karino?\nMadudi Meeoiba Eikhoina Pokpadagi siba faoba punsi matek asibu lai haraoba kou e , Haibadi pokpana laihou punsi matek aduna lai haraoba, sibana numitpuna lairoi kou e.\n\nMeeoiba Eikhoina harao tayambagi langla matang amada yanduna soifadraba asibabu kaothoktuna hingnari Masibuna Meena haraoba kou e.Lai haraoba haiba kumhei asi meetei wanguba , samna LAINING lambitana tasinduna semlamba kumhei amani.\n\nAsita nattana Meetei Eenat eesel Fijat chakcha loinana sinlon kangleilol chatna kanglon asina chingba suna yaoraba kumhei ni samna hairabada Meetei lai haraoba haiba kumhei aside Meeteibu masak takpa kumhei ni.\n\nLai haraoba da asumna seisakli 'Sibu thoina haraoba leibara , Leibani  masi Kari hairibano ?\nMadudi Meena haraoba thoiba masi nattaba lai na haraoba ama Lei haibane.\n\nHaibadi mapan thong gi Meena haraoriba kumhei asida penthoktuna nunge Wangulon punli haibani Meeoiba eikhoide pal gi kumheida taoduna lei .\n\nLai haraoba haiba kumhei asibu achangba ama oina loinabatani.Pikliba angang singna lai phadibibu sanaduna harao tayamna  lai phadibi adudi haraode .\n\nAsigumna Meeoiba eikhoi asibu mapu magi sanapotni maram maduna Meeoiba Eikhoina harao tayamna ngaijaktang hingjariba punsi matek asi mapu mana haraohanlibani .\n\n Meeoiba Eikhoina ngaijaktang haraoriba aside mapu magi sanapotni maram aduna Meeoiba Eikhoina haraoTayamna ngaijaktang hingjariba punsi matek asi mapu mana haraoribani.\n\n Meeoiba Eikhoina ngaijaktang haraoriba aside mapu mana haraobagi mami aduniMaram Sina Meeoibana Pokpadagi siba tanba faoba punsi matek adubu lai haraoba kou e hairibani.\n"
